{"id":"cf3112cb2fc40702","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-sigma3-unique-row.md","title":"Σ₃ 的唯一无限行表示","display":"thm-sigma3-unique-row — Σ₃ 的唯一无限行表示","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-sigma3-unique-row","aliases":["20-thm-sigma3-unique-row"],"display":"thm-sigma3-unique-row — Σ₃ 的唯一无限行表示","chapter":"4","section":"4.3.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.11","source_printed_pages":[90,91],"source_pdf_pages":[126,127],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-sigma3-unique-row"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-sigma3-unique-row</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sigma3-unique-row — Σ₃ 的唯一无限行表示"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90</span><span>91</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>126</span><span>127</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b18750fb01771e3\" href=\"?note=6b18750fb01771e3\" title=\"20-thm-sigma3-representation\">20-thm-sigma3-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\">\\(S\\in\\Sigma_3^0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为行表示，肯定情形最终全部行为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，此前行均有限或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6b18750fb01771e3\" href=\"?note=6b18750fb01771e3\" title=\"20-thm-sigma3-representation\">20-thm-sigma3-representation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma3-unique-row}\\vdash\n\\exists h:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nh\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\forall x\\\n[(x\\in S\\Rightarrow\\exists!i\\ [W_{h(x,i)}=\\omega\\land\\forall j\\ne i\\ |W_{h(x,j)}|&lt;\\omega])\\\\\n\\land(x\\notin S\\Rightarrow\\forall i\\ |W_{h(x,i)}|&lt;\\omega)]\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma3-unique-row}\\vdash\n\\exists h:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nh\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\forall x\\\n[(x\\in S\\Rightarrow\\exists!i\\ [W_{h(x,i)}=\\omega\\land\\forall j\\ne i\\ |W_{h(x,j)}|&lt;\\omega])\\\\\n\\land(x\\notin S\\Rightarrow\\forall i\\ |W_{h(x,i)}|&lt;\\omega)]\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x,y,s)=y+\\sum_{z&lt;y}|W_{g(x,z),s}|\">\\(q(x,y,s)=y+\\sum_{z&lt;y}|W_{g(x,z),s}|\\)</span>；阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 将第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 行已枚举内容复制到输出行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x,y,s)\">\\(q(x,y,s)\\)</span>，只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le s\">\\(y\\le s\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_0\">\\(y_0\\)</span> 是首个无限行，它为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，其输出位置最终稳定且得到全部自然数。更低源行有限；更高源行的位置因低行增长而趋于无限。固定输出行只能接收 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le i\">\\(y\\le i\\)</span> 的内容，所以其余行有限。若没有无限源行，每个固定输出行接收有限多个有限来源，仍有限。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.3.11；印刷页 90, 91；PDF 第 126, 127 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-sigma3-representation","status":"resolved","id":"6b18750fb01771e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-sigma3-representation","status":"resolved","id":"6b18750fb01771e3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sigma3-representation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in\\Sigma_3^0","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma3-unique-row}\\vdash\n\\exists h:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\nh\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\forall x\\\n[(x\\in S\\Rightarrow\\exists!i\\ [W_{h(x,i)}=\\omega\\land\\forall j\\ne i\\ |W_{h(x,j)}|<\\omega])\\\\\n\\land(x\\notin S\\Rightarrow\\forall i\\ |W_{h(x,i)}|<\\omega)]\\end{gathered}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"q(x,y,s)=y+\\sum_{z<y}|W_{g(x,z),s}|","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"q(x,y,s)","display":false},{"tex":"y\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"y_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"y\\le i","display":false}],"bytes":1819,"backlinks":[{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-sigma3-unique-row]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-409","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-sigma3-unique-row]] — 章 4；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-409","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-sigma3-unique-row]]"}],"outgoing":["6b18750fb01771e3","4ef1aee16db6b308","8ba6597a854c206f","e343870c773cb68e"]}